# Ignore file for apps/checkout/Dockerfile only. BuildKit (the default builder
# in current Docker and Compose) reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in place of
# the context-root .dockerignore; the legacy builder falls back to the root
# file.
#
# Allowlist: the context is the repository root, and this image needs
# apps/checkout, sdk/ and the one document /gizlilik renders -- nothing else.
# That keeps data/ (recorded real sessions), .env and the host's node_modules
# (a Windows host's packages laid over the Linux tree `npm ci` built) out.
*
!apps/checkout
!sdk
!docs/kvkk-aydinlatma.md

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
